{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"LOOP ITERATION 14 — read-only prep while J9's review holds the LLM gate (serializing, per the lesson\nthat concurrent reviews worsen API failures and lock contention).\n\nCONCRETE FINDING for whoever writes the ADR: ADR 0035's 'first real second backend is out of scope'\nclaim appears in THREE places, not one. This story's AC says 'ADR 0035 carries a pointer to the\namendment and its section 6 statement is corrected' — singular — which would leave two stale\nstatements behind:\n\n  :111      '<backend-x>/              # future second backend'   (layout diagram comment)\n  :204-205  prose: 'The first *real* second backend (a GitHub adapter) is out of scope here and is\n            tracked by epic be74-7832-03a8-48ac.'\n  :236-237  Decision item 6: 'The first real second backend is out of scope for this ADR and is\n            tracked separately by epic be74-7832-03a8-48ac.'\n\nAll three are now falsified by this epic: e369 landed a DIFFERENT second backend (Jira Data Center)\nFIRST, ahead of the GitHub adapter be74 was reserved for. Correcting only Decision item 6 leaves the\nprose at :204 and the diagram comment at :111 asserting the same wrong thing, and a future reader is\nas likely to hit those as the Decision list.\n\nRecording this rather than editing the plan, because a review is in flight and editing mid-review\nwastes the round. Fold it into the next revision alongside whatever round 3 returns.\n\nAlso still pending on this ticket: the TWENTY-ONE member-count fix is applied, but NO re-review has run\nsince — J8's last completed review was round 2 (1 blocking finding, now fixed). Round 3 is queued\nbehind J9's round 9."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785491396595243001,"uuid":"f24741a6-d55a-486b-8121-a1249c5c4469"}